- At most **{{ max_tags }} hashtags**{% if first_tag %}, with **#{{ first_tag }} first** on TikTok{% endif %} (spec
  `hashtags`, written without the `#`).
- {% for r in rules %}{{ r }}{% if not loop.last %}. {% endif %}{% endfor %}.
- The `caption` step writes `final/caption.txt` (read by the Publish tab) plus `caption_<platform>.txt`, and fails if a spec
